{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le09ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Wow, I'm glad that week is over! I hope that your week was better than mine.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: It was good! I reckon that you've had a hard week. What happened?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Well, apparently my team told my editor that I wasn't pulling my weight. I don't understand! I have been working hard ever since I got here. I suppose I've been a bit slow, but I've been trying hard to pick things up! I've done everything that I've been asked to do.  The people I work with haven't been particularly helpful either. And the training that I received wasn't great. No one showed me how to order paper.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You mustn't blame your coworkers. I understand that you've been put with one of the best teams. Sometimes you ought to be more proactive. Maybe you need to take the initiative and ask what you can do instead of waiting for people to tell you what to do. I imagine you've worked hard at the tasks you've been given, but you should do more than just the minimum. You've got to work to pitch in wherever you can.", "id": 2, "time": "33000"}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob11re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: You're right. My editor asked whether I thought my job was a good fit for me or not. I promised him that I would work harder. But how about you? How was your second week?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Great! My editor asked if I wanted to work on editing a whole book. It's a lot of responsibility, but I think I should show some confidence and take on the challenge.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Of course! You've got to accept more responsibility when it's offered to you. Congratulations! You must have really impressed him.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Thanks! I just don't want to get in over my head.", "id": 3, "time": "56800"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can request or report facts about events or actions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my work responsibilities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever felt like you were in over your head? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What are some things you can do when you are in an overwhelming situation?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nKristi and Adam <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">debrief</span> after their first week.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_